              "quote": "This Prior Approval supplemental new drug application provides for revisions in the United States Package Insert (USPI) for Livalo to incorporate safety and efficacy data of pitavastatin use in pediatric patients 8 years and older with heterozygous familial hypercholesterolemia (HeFH) to reduce elevated TC, LDL-C, and Apo B to fulfill the requirements of a Written Request issued by FDA to Kowa Pharmaceuticals America, Inc. on November 2, 2016.",
